### 10.3 P1-2 — direct-parent admission is content-validated (review_wait.py)

RED (packet mode accepted the bypass shapes first):

```bash
node --test --test-name-pattern='review packet parent' tests/review-transport.test.cjs
```

→ `fail 1` — first real failure: "parent session repeated in an extension field
beside review_history: expected rejection".

Repair: `validate_packet_review_history(packet, repo_root)` now (a) rejects every
foreign review reference anywhere outside the exact
`review_history.parent_summary_ref` field (a lone extension reference, or the same
parent session repeated elsewhere); (b) observes the parent SUMMARY through the
existing bounded stable no-follow regular-file read and rejects missing or
non-ordinary files; (c) requires `parent_summary_digest` to equal the observed bytes;
(d) rejects duplicate `unresolved_blocking_ids`; (e) rejects ids absent from the
parent findings; (f) rejects ids whose parent severity is not P0/P1; (g) requires the
parent SUMMARY's mode, change_id, and task_ids to equal the current packet's. An
initial packet with no foreign reference stays valid. No registry, history database,
or semantic scorer was added; the full archive remains readable only for separately
owner-requested incident or audit work.

GREEN: same command → `pass 1 / fail 0` (exit 0), covering 1 positive, 13 rejections,
and the no-history initial packet.

